+     content it carries. -->
+
+Review findings to fix:
+
+1. `validateTitle` (src/domain/task.ts) rejected titles shaped like `task-N`, although `find` already looks up ids before titles, so the rule added no safety and refused valid titles. Removed the rule.
+2. The regex duplicated the id format generated in list.ts. It went away with the rule.
+
+The obsolete test is replaced by one asserting such titles are accepted and ids still resolve first.
